<description>&lt;p&gt;Thailand is intensifying border security as police chiefs order tighter controls while Thailand and Myanmar begin joint water-quality monitoring of their border rivers and China sends experts to investigate Mekong pollution at the Thai-Myanmar frontier. A Chanthaburi man confessed to an acid attack on his wife, and a father and son were jailed for smuggling about £500,000 of cannabis from Thailand. CP All will close all 7-Eleven stores in Cambodia on December 25 and Thais have donated 269 million baht for a Thai-Cambodian border fence and shelters, while the ASEAN Express rail freight service expands economic ties. 35 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxNcUpsRzU0UGYxVkZCSEoxZEswM1VjdHJqYWRtNFlIdHBUSy1XWVdXeXV6d3hFYktIR3Z0VGtPeW5YSkYwZDhoallmLUVnbjVBeW5jSnZwb2plU2tEQjNSX1hBbGxoc0FtVVotRVlubDR0YVNRTzUyMGRqWEFsMWNJT0RYXzRwNWxyWXpvdnVHeWpZU05oZWJfc0pUZEE2cU0?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxOXzZ0NGV5S25BUTZnT2JrdHlCVVZkYjZjNEJ4S2pYUk1jb2FNQmFUSGRaNXZOcWE1X0NEZ2NFbDMtTFloMzhkLUtTQ2owRVVXeVNfM09iNzl5b1g3NmU3emhPbXJLMkxFeGgyMldETG9YSnJyZFF5MFYyMWI3aHJJVWNzaTY4dF9ZQUloSHRlYW5iOUZjV3dGZQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;CNA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxOU2FMSnFmcFdLZEoyc29RQzNJMW1xd21MQWdDNWFiUFJEOFM2S0VEMTAydWk3VlpFMi1CYXdLR2w2UmJicklDa0RTb2V4ZTdwMXoyT3p1TXl3eURuc0FtSkh1TWtsR0x3RzV3Qy14TVZEWjBSenlYYU00U2YzSVE3cld2R1RuNTBSMjFqbHBXbW11eGJTM2dpMVZRSmF6REU0VnBzSTVIOGhMRXRJd0wwS2FwSk5qZTFkQ0xTR3ZFVktoZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Social News XYZ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTE9tWXNpbWNJYlZPMmFUazkzTFpaN3A0WXBOOXh